OL,3,ASupreme Court revives controversial US
OL,4,Adata system for citizenship checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Supreme Court has lifted
OL,7,Frestrictions on the Trump
OL,8,Fadministration to use a controversial
OL,9,Ffederal voter database, which uses
OL,10,Fcitizenship information and other
OL,11,Fsensitive data to filter alleged
OL,12,Fnon-citizen voting.
OL,14,FCritics warn the ruling could lead to
OL,15,Fvalid voters being removed from
OL,16,Felectoral rolls.
OL,18,FThe ruling marks a victory for the
OL,19,FTrump administration as it seeks to
OL,20,Fclamp down on allegations of
OL,21,Fnon-citizen voting.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
