OL,3,ASupreme Court revives controversial US
OL,4,Adata system for citizenship checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe three liberal-leaning liberals on
OL,7,Fthe Supreme Court dissented from the
OL,8,Fdecision, with the other six
OL,9,Fconservative justices supporting it. In
OL,10,FJune, a federal judge ruled that the
OL,11,Fsystem was illegal and violated the
OL,12,Fprivacy rights of Americans.
